title: TopicHub
---
<<SetShot "TwoShot">>

<<if TurnsLeft() == 0>>
    <<jump End>>
<<endif>>

<<PrepareTopics {GetCurrentActor()} "PlayerToCharacter" 3>>

-> Talk about {TopicDisplayName(0)} <<if HasPreparedTopic(0)>>
    <<detour {SelectTopic(0)}>>
    <<CountPlayerTurn>>
-> Talk about {TopicDisplayName(1)} <<if HasPreparedTopic(1)>>
    <<detour {SelectTopic(1)}>>
    <<CountPlayerTurn>>
-> Talk about {TopicDisplayName(2)} <<if HasPreparedTopic(2)>>
    <<detour {SelectTopic(2)}>>
    <<CountPlayerTurn>>
-> Think of something else <<if CanRefreshPreparedTopics()>>
    Prince: Let me think again.
    <<TakeTurn>>
    <<jump TopicHub>>
-> Give word to {GetCurrentActor()}
    Prince: You got something to say?
    <<jump PrepareTopicHubNPC>>
-> Finish conversation
    Prince: I think that's all for now.
    <<jump End>>
    
<<jump PrepareTopicHubNPC>>
===

